{
  "Manage Property is the admin hub for the cabin picked at the top. Here you set up and edit everything about this one place — its details, the people who can use it, and the rules the rest of the app relies on.": "Manage Property is the admin hub for the cabin picked at the top. Here you set up and edit everything about this one place — its details, the people who can use it, and the rules the rest of the app relies on.",
  "The property itself": "The property itself",
  "Info, Contacts, and Ownership cover the basic facts and who owns what. Structures, Infrastructure, and Equipment list the buildings, systems, and gear at the cabin.": "Info, Contacts, and Ownership cover the basic facts and who owns what. Structures, Infrastructure, and Equipment list the buildings, systems, and gear at the cabin.",
  "People & access": "People & access",
  "Users are everyone with access, User groups bundle people together to share access and costs, and Invites let you add new people by email.": "Users are everyone with access, User groups bundle people together to share access and costs, and Invites let you add new people by email.",
  "Rules & money": "Rules & money",
  "Split policy sets how shared costs are divided, Priority weeks let each main owner group claim one of the peak summer weeks (28–30), Expense categories label spending, and Settings holds per-cabin preferences.": "Split policy sets how shared costs are divided, Priority weeks let each main owner group claim one of the peak summer weeks (28–30), Expense categories label spending, and Settings holds per-cabin preferences.",
